{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sub-Species is a 2.5D Arcade Action/Adventure, where you control a submarine that rotates 360\u00b0 in order to battle alien sea monsters that will be coming at you from all angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore the contaminated zones,  outmanoeuvring and fighting aggressive alien lifeforms that have overrun these areas of the ocean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/38ebd1722d554eb70f2d9c5af3a1e405.poster.avif?t=1773149921\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/38ebd1722d554eb70f2d9c5af3a1e405.webm?t=1773149921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/38ebd1722d554eb70f2d9c5af3a1e405.mp4?t=1773149921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across 12 levels in 4 environments, as you search for new weapons and lost experimental technology amongst the shipwrecks and naval outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/c655f8ed647fbfbce827add06a79cc7f.poster.avif?t=1773149921\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/c655f8ed647fbfbce827add06a79cc7f.webm?t=1773149921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/c655f8ed647fbfbce827add06a79cc7f.mp4?t=1773149921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Story unfolds, uncover the secrets of the emerging alien world, and the naval authorities that control it.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/3727f5854376e5346ecc4d5464a74f83.poster.avif?t=1773149921\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/3727f5854376e5346ecc4d5464a74f83.webm?t=1773149921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/3727f5854376e5346ecc4d5464a74f83.mp4?t=1773149921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3779120?t=1773149921","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/954c58232a9ad51c6974a086a7ff2b51e210e0fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773149921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/d6b567ab9e720f484fe7e23c216ac798121d11fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773149921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/d6b567ab9e720f484fe7e23c216ac798121d11fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773149921","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4160530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_parag