1773149921","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/1285b962ffaa6e8d7a5a379c45f801f90f908d4b/ss_1285b962ffaa6e8d7a5a379c45f801f90f908d4b.600x338.jpg?t=1773149921"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/b41d111b320a92b5d9e375ee5c71cc5775861999/ss_b41d111b320a92b5d9e375ee5c71cc5775861999.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773149921","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/b41d111b320a92b5d9e375ee5c71cc5775861999/ss_b41d111b320a92b5d9e375ee5c71cc5775861999.600x338.jpg?t=1773149921"}],"short_description":"At first the alien outbreak spreading throughout the oceans was confined. We delayed our extinction rather than avert it. As part of a salvage crew, you search the hellish containment zones, where a treasure trove of lost tech can help you and your crew eke out a living in a slowly dying world.","steam_appid":3779120,"support_info":{"email":"howlinghamstergames@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://Sub-Species.com"}